Z||000003||batboy||10-19-2000||12:18 PM||||Hey, I wasn't trying to bite Al, I was tired and he was just giving me a piggy-back-ride (batty-back-ride?). This is the pic from the National Inquirer that earned me my nickname.<P>  <IMG SRC="http://sites.netscape.net/batboybain/batboy.jpg">  <P>One of my caver buddies published that pic in our little cave club newsletter with a fictious story about me as a joke about eight years ago. Various batboy story have popped up occasionally in the tabloids in the last few years.<p>[This message has been edited by batboy (edited 10-19-2000).]||||reg||1
